# Thread memory path pattern

Path pattern:
lupo-memory/{channel_key}/{trust_tier}/{year}/{month}/{thread_slug}.toon

Trust tiers:
- staging -> calendar year (example: 2026)
- canonical -> offset year (calendar year - 1000, example: 1026)

Write flow:
- Agent start: write/update staging toon with status "in_progress"
- Agent complete: update staging toon with status "completed"
- THOTH promotion: copy to canonical path and set trust_tier to canonical

Example:
- lupo-memory/development/staging/2026/04/hermes-design.toon
- lupo-memory/development/canonical/1026/04/hermes-design.toon
